## 6. 结果汇报建议

建议客户做完 Step 1-2 后整理:

```
release_v3/
├── enrichment/
│   ├── chr5_qtl6_eggnog.emapper.annotations
│   ├── chr5_qtl6_GO_BP.tsv         # Top 富集 BP terms
│   ├── chr5_qtl6_KEGG.tsv          # 富集通路
│   └── known_drought_overlap.tsv   # 已知抗旱基因 overlap
└── enrichment_report.md             # 叙事性解读
```

这是后续 `task-bsa-enrichment` + `task-bsa-report` 的核心产出。

